These `.tflite` files are copied from MicroFlow:

  https://github.com/matteocarnelos/microflow-rs

MicroFlow is dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 (Copyright 2024 Matteo Carnelos).
The models themselves originate from TensorFlow Lite / MLPerf Tiny examples
(`hello_world` sine, micro_speech, and person detection) and are redistributed
here so CI can import and code-generate them without a private checkout.

Upstream copies (same bytes as MicroFlow `models/` on `main`):

- sine.tflite
- speech.tflite
- person_detect.tflite
